#500 sgideprimop DETECTOR -- binary=/tmp/gx500p5/gxemul label=PREFIX
row              got            want           note                                         
live             0x5a5a5a5a     0x5a5a5a5a     RAM round-trips through the same decode -- the probe can see anything at all ok
devsig           1              1              a byte access makes the DEVICE speak -- RAM emits no text, ever ok
pt surv          exit1          exit0          PT (0x00000000) is declined, not fatal       FAIL
pt live          died           0x0            ...and the guest RUNS ON -- kills a death however it is spelled FAIL
pt decl          0              1              ...announced ONCE with the FULL literal -- kills a text revert FAIL
tri surv         exit1          exit0          TRI (0x02000000) is declined, not fatal      FAIL
tri live         died           0x0            ...and the guest RUNS ON -- kills a death however it is spelled FAIL
tri decl         0              1              ...announced ONCE with the FULL literal -- kills a text revert FAIL
reset surv       exit1          exit0          START with PRIMITIVE never written -- the reset value IS POINT FAIL
reset live       died           0x0            ...and the guest RUNS ON                     FAIL
reset decl       0              1              ...announced with the FULL literal -- the draw really happened FAIL
two once         1              1              TWO distinct declined ops, ONE message -- kills a dropped |= (flood) ok
two live         died           0x0            ...and the guest survives both               FAIL
rd surv          exit1          exit0          a START-aliased READ also draws, and is declined FAIL
rd decl          0              1              ...announced with the FULL literal -- kills a write-only repair FAIL
xlatch decl      0              1              prim-op decline fires even AFTER another latch set -- kills a shared bit FAIL
xlatch live      died           0x0            ...and the guest survives the composed session FAIL
xlatch unm       0              1              decline fires after BOTH #499 unmapped latches -- kills an alias onto 1<<7 or 1<<8 FAIL
xlatch unliv     died           0x0            ...and the guest RUNS ON through the four-access session FAIL
acc rect         0              0              RECTANGLE is IMPLEMENTED -- it must NOT be declined ok
acc live         0x0            0x0            ...and the guest runs on                     ok
acc rect mod     0              0              RECTANGLE|ALL 24 maskable low bits -- ANY mask widening reds this row ok
acc rect liv     0x0            0x0            ...and the guest RUNS ON -- the row above is not satisfied by nothing happening ok
acc line mod     0              0              LINE|ALL 24 maskable low bits likewise -- both implemented primitives ok
acc line liv     0x0            0x0            ...and the guest RUNS ON                     ok
dec b26          0              1              0x05000000 = LINE|bit26 MUST decline -- kills a mask narrowed at bit 26 FAIL
dec b27          0              1              0x09000000 = LINE|bit27 MUST decline -- kills a mask narrowed at bit 27 FAIL
dec b28          0              1              0x11000000 = LINE|bit28 MUST decline -- kills a mask narrowed at bit 28 FAIL
dec b29          0              1              0x21000000 = LINE|bit29 MUST decline -- kills a mask narrowed at bit 29 FAIL
dec b30          0              1              0x41000000 = LINE|bit30 MUST decline -- kills a mask narrowed at bit 30 FAIL
dec b31          0              1              0x81000000 = LINE|bit31 MUST decline -- kills a mask narrowed at bit 31 FAIL
dec hi liv       died           0x0            ...and the guest RUNS ON after the highest-bit decline FAIL
NOROW  mask narrowing at bit 24 or 25           -- collapses LINE onto RECTANGLE rather than killing the host; needs a drawing oracle, and none exists at reset
NOROW  the drawing itself                       -- a declined op draws nothing and no row asserts what a correct POINT or TRIANGLE would render
OPUS500_RESULT=9/32
OPUS500_LABEL=PREFIX
OPUS500_RED=pt surv,pt live,pt decl,tri surv,tri live,tri decl,reset surv,reset live,reset decl,two live,rd surv,rd decl,xlatch decl,xlatch live,xlatch unm,xlatch unliv,dec b26,dec b27,dec b28,dec b29,dec b30,dec b31,dec hi liv
